{"book":"2Jo","name":"2 John","chapters":{"1":{"1":{"text":"The elder unto the elect lady and her children, whom I love in the truth; and not I only, but also all they that have known the truth;","words":[{"t":"The"},{"t":"elder","s":["G4245"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"elect","s":["G1588"]},{"t":"lady","s":["G2959"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"her","s":["G846"]},{"t":"children,","s":["G5043"]},{"t":"whom","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"I","s":["G1473"]},{"t":"love","s":["G25"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth;","s":["G225"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"I","s":["G1473"]},{"t":"only,","s":["G3441"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"also","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"all","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"they"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"known","s":["G1097"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth;","s":["G225"]}]},"2":{"text":"For the truth's sake, which dwelleth in us, and shall be with us for ever.","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1223"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"truth's"},{"t":"sake,","s":["G225"]},{"t":"which","s":["G3588"]},{"t":"dwelleth","s":["G3306"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"us,","s":["G2254"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"shall"},{"t":"be","s":["G2071"]},{"t":"with","s":["G3326"]},{"t":"us","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"for","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"ever.","s":["G165"]}]},"3":{"text":"Grace be with you, mercy, and peace, from God the Father, and from the Lord Jesus Christ, the Son of the Father, in truth and love.","words":[{"t":"Grace","s":["G5485"]},{"t":"be","s":["G2071"]},{"t":"with","s":["G3326"]},{"t":"you,","s":["G5216"]},{"t":"mercy,","s":["G1656"]},{"t":"and"},{"t":"peace,","s":["G1515"]},{"t":"from","s":["G3844"]},{"t":"God","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Father,","s":["G3962"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"from","s":["G3844"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Lord","s":["G2962"]},{"t":"Jesus","s":["G2424"]},{"t":"Christ,","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Son","s":["G5207"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Father,","s":["G3962"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"truth","s":["G225"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"love.","s":["G26"]}]},"4":{"text":"I rejoiced greatly that I found of thy children walking in truth, as we have received a commandment from the Father.","words":[{"t":"I"},{"t":"rejoiced","s":["G5463"]},{"t":"greatly","s":["G3029"]},{"t":"that","s":["G3754"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"found","s":["G2147"]},{"t":"of","s":["G1537"]},{"t":"thy","s":["G4675"]},{"t":"children","s":["G5043"]},{"t":"walking","s":["G4043"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"truth,","s":["G225"]},{"t":"as","s":["G2531"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"received","s":["G2983"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"commandment","s":["G1785"]},{"t":"from","s":["G3844"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Father.","s":["G3962"]}]},"5":{"text":"And now I beseech thee, lady, not as though I wrote a new commandment unto thee, but that which we had from the beginning, that we love one another.","words":[{"t":"And","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"now","s":["G3568"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"beseech","s":["G2065"]},{"t":"thee,","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"lady,","s":["G2959"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"as"},{"t":"though","s":["G5613"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"wrote","s":["G1125","G1125"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"new","s":["G2537"]},{"t":"commandment","s":["G1785"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"thee,","s":["G4671"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"had","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"from","s":["G575"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"beginning,","s":["G746"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"love","s":["G25"]},{"t":"one"},{"t":"another.","s":["G240"]}]},"6":{"text":"And this is love, that we walk after his commandments. This is the commandment, That, as ye have heard from the beginning, ye should walk in it.","words":[{"t":"And","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"this","s":["G3778"]},{"t":"is","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"love,","s":["G26"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"walk","s":["G4043"]},{"t":"after","s":["G2596"]},{"t":"his","s":["G846"]},{"t":"commandments.","s":["G1785"]},{"t":"This","s":["G3778"]},{"t":"is","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"commandment,","s":["G1785"]},{"t":"That,","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"as","s":["G2531"]},{"t":"ye"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"heard","s":["G191"]},{"t":"from","s":["G575"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"beginning,","s":["G746"]},{"t":"ye"},{"t":"should"},{"t":"walk","s":["G4043"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"it.","s":["G846"]}]},"7":{"text":"For many deceivers are entered into the world, who confess not that Jesus Christ is come in the flesh. This is a deceiver and an antichrist.","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G3754"]},{"t":"many","s":["G4183"]},{"t":"deceivers","s":["G4108"]},{"t":"are"},{"t":"entered","s":["G1525"]},{"t":"into","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"world,","s":["G2889"]},{"t":"who","s":["G3588"]},{"t":"confess","s":["G3670"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"Jesus","s":["G2424"]},{"t":"Christ","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"is"},{"t":"come","s":["G2064"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"flesh.","s":["G4561"]},{"t":"This","s":["G3778"]},{"t":"is","s":["G2076"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"deceiver","s":["G4108"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"an"},{"t":"antichrist.","s":["G500"]}]},"8":{"text":"Look to yourselves, that ➔ we lose not those things which we have wrought, but that we receive a full reward.","words":[{"t":"Look","s":["G991"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"yourselves,","s":["G1438"]},{"t":"that","s":["G3363"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"we"},{"t":"lose","s":["G622"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3363"]},{"t":"those"},{"t":"things"},{"t":"which","s":["G3739"]},{"t":"we"},{"t":"have"},{"t":"wrought,","s":["G2038"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"that"},{"t":"we"},{"t":"receive","s":["G618"]},{"t":"a"},{"t":"full","s":["G4134"]},{"t":"reward.","s":["G3408"]}]},"9":{"text":"Whosoever transgresseth, and abideth not in the doctrine of Christ, hath not God. He that abideth in the doctrine of Christ, he hath both the Father and the Son.","words":[{"t":"Whosoever","s":["G3956"]},{"t":"transgresseth,","s":["G3845"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"abideth","s":["G3306"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"doctrine","s":["G1322"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"Christ,","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"hath","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"God.","s":["G2316"]},{"t":"He"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"abideth","s":["G3306"]},{"t":"in","s":["G1722"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"doctrine","s":["G1322"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"Christ,","s":["G5547"]},{"t":"he","s":["G3778"]},{"t":"hath","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"both","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Father","s":["G3962"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"the"},{"t":"Son.","s":["G5207"]}]},"10":{"text":"If ➔ there come any unto you, and bring not this doctrine, receive him not into your house, neither bid him God speed:","words":[{"t":"If","s":["G1536"]},{"t":"➔"},{"t":"there"},{"t":"come","s":["G2064"]},{"t":"any","s":["G1536","G5100"]},{"t":"unto","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"you,","s":["G5209"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"bring","s":["G5342"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"this","s":["G5026"]},{"t":"doctrine,","s":["G1322"]},{"t":"receive","s":["G2983"]},{"t":"him","s":["G846"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3361"]},{"t":"into","s":["G1519"]},{"t":"your"},{"t":"house,","s":["G3614"]},{"t":"neither","s":["G2532","G3361"]},{"t":"bid","s":["G3004"]},{"t":"him","s":["G846"]},{"t":"God"},{"t":"speed:","s":["G5463"]}]},"11":{"text":"For he that biddeth him God speed is partaker of his evil deeds.","words":[{"t":"For","s":["G1063"]},{"t":"he"},{"t":"that"},{"t":"biddeth","s":["G3004"]},{"t":"him","s":["G846"]},{"t":"God"},{"t":"speed","s":["G5463"]},{"t":"is"},{"t":"partaker","s":["G2841"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"his","s":["G846"]},{"t":"evil","s":["G4190"]},{"t":"deeds.","s":["G2041"]}]},"12":{"text":"Having many things to write unto you, I would not write with paper and ink: but I trust to come unto you, and speak face to face, that our joy may be full.","words":[{"t":"Having","s":["G2192"]},{"t":"many"},{"t":"things","s":["G4183"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"write","s":["G1125"]},{"t":"unto"},{"t":"you,","s":["G5213"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"would","s":["G1014"]},{"t":"not","s":["G3756"]},{"t":"write"},{"t":"with","s":["G1223"]},{"t":"paper","s":["G5489"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"ink:","s":["G3188"]},{"t":"but","s":["G235"]},{"t":"I"},{"t":"trust","s":["G1679"]},{"t":"to"},{"t":"come","s":["G2064"]},{"t":"unto","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"you,","s":["G5209"]},{"t":"and","s":["G2532"]},{"t":"speak","s":["G2980"]},{"t":"face","s":["G4750"]},{"t":"to","s":["G4314"]},{"t":"face,","s":["G4750"]},{"t":"that","s":["G2443"]},{"t":"our","s":["G2257"]},{"t":"joy","s":["G5479"]},{"t":"may"},{"t":"be","s":["G5600"]},{"t":"full.","s":["G4137"]}]},"13":{"text":"The children of thy elect sister greet thee. Amen.","words":[{"t":"The"},{"t":"children","s":["G5043"]},{"t":"of"},{"t":"thy","s":["G4675"]},{"t":"elect","s":["G1588"]},{"t":"sister","s":["G79"]},{"t":"greet","s":["G782"]},{"t":"thee.","s":["G4571"]},{"t":"Amen.","s":["G281"]}]}}}}